@startuml
title Book and pay for a class | FR-007/009 | BR-021–026/034–038/068
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam activityBorderColor #475569
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #475569
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam stateBorderColor #475569
start
:Learner asks to book a class;
if (Is this a repeat of the same request?) then (Yes)
 :Return the existing booking without creating another;
 stop
endif
if (Class open, seat available, not own class,\nno existing active booking, starts in at least 24 hours,\nand lasts 30–180 minutes?) then (Yes)
 :Hold a seat for 15 minutes\nand keep the price agreed at booking;
else (No)
 :Refuse the booking and explain why;\ndo not take payment;
 stop
endif
:Show booking as Awaiting confirmation;
if (Learner confirms before the system cancels the hold?) then (Yes)
 :Save the booking as Confirmed;
 :Return the confirmation to the Learner;
 :Process the wallet payment in the background;
 if (Does the wallet payment succeed?) then (Yes)
  :Deduct the full price from the Learner;\nallocate Teacher income and the 10% platform fee together;
  :Keep Teacher income on hold until release is allowed;
 else (No)
  :Retry payment processing;\nkeep unresolved failures for investigation;
  note right
   Current gap against BR-022/026:
   confirmation is saved before payment succeeds.
   A failed payment does not automatically undo confirmation.
  end note
 endif
else (No)
 :System cancels the expired hold\nand makes the seat available again;
endif
note left
 Current confirmation checks booking status.
 It does not check the 15-minute deadline itself.
end note
stop
@enduml
